# A guest throws a brick at a heavy cabinet with a mug on top; the host carries the cabinet away.
scenario cabinet_carry
scene cabinet_mug
seed 9
guests 1
settle 8s

net g1 rtt 80ms jitter 10ms loss 1%

p1 grab brick as brick
p1 wait 300ms
p1 throw cabinet speed 9 as throw
at 4s p0 walk cabinet
p0 grab cabinet as lift
p0 walk -1 -1.5
p0 drop as put

expect result brick granted
expect result throw done
expect result lift granted
expect result put done
expect agree_at_rest 5cm 5deg
expect no_stuck
